esets** \u2014 Zen Room, Dark Meditation, Mosaic Mandala, Cloud\n  Sky, Flower Field, and Real Mandala\n  - **Mixed Reality mode** \u2014 meditate in your own room using device passthrough\n  - **Seasonal gardens** \u2014 Spring cherry blossoms, Summer green, Autumn foliage,\n   Winter snow\n  - **Time-of-day lighting** \u2014 Morning, Day, Evening, Night\n  - **Adjustable playback speed** and ambient BGM\n  - **Freely reposition** all canvases in 3D space\n\n  Perfect for daily meditation, mindfulness practice, or experiencing the beauty\n   of Japanese Buddhist tradition in VR.", "short_description": "Experience the Heart Sutra in a serene Japanese zen room. Meditate with calligraphy, mokugyo, singing bowl, and six immersive spatial presets."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.tomocreateinc.com/en/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Tomocreate, Inc.", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.tomocreateinc.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "810139357995560"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "ja"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1072321129306035"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1730549881302600"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1730549881302600"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1780348980, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1730549881302600"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_suppo